# Symmetry-mode analysis (crystod-group --supergroup-cif); testsuite section 16
# AMPLIMODES-style decomposition of a group-subgroup distortion into parent irreps
# with mode amplitudes. References in ~/CrystOD-main/AMPLIMODES (Bilbao AMPLIMODES
# PDFs: SrTiO3 Pm-3m -> I4/mcm R5- 0.3303 A; ZrO2 Fm-3m -> P4_2/nmc X2- 0.5773 A).

